@startuml
|Lecturer|
start
:Enter student email and details;
:Click "Add Student" button;

|AddStudentEmailPage|
:Send request to AuthController;

|AuthController|
:Validate email format and details;

|StudentService|
:Check for existing student records;

|StudentService|
:Validate data;

if (Data is valid?) then (yes)
    :Generate auto-generated password;
    :Save student account;

    if (Account creation succeeded?) then (yes)
        |EmailService|
        :Create email content;
        :Send email with password and instructions;
        :Return email status;
    else (no)
        |AddStudentEmailPage|
        :Display error message;
    endif
else (no)
    |AddStudentEmailPage|
    :Display error message;
endif

|AddStudentEmailPage|
:Display addition status;
stop
@enduml
